      "note": "<div data-citation-items=\"%5B%5D\" data-schema-version=\"8\"><h1>注释<br/>(2022/12/17 下午11:45:58)</h1>\n<h3>部编版8年级道法上册【高清教材】.pdf</h3>\n<p><span class=\"highlight\" data-annotation=\"%7B%22attachmentURI%22%3A%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F10326904%2Fitems%2FWUQZW3QQ%22%2C%22annotationKey%22%3A%22HDTJ43QV%22%2C%22color%22%3A%22%23ffd400%22%2C%22pageLabel%22%3A%229%22%2C%22position%22%3A%7B%22pageIndex%22%3A8%2C%22rects%22%3A%5B%5B179.906%2C532.196%2C462.266%2C545.977%5D%2C%5B155.906%2C513.392%2C461.852%2C527.173%5D%2C%5B155.906%2C494.588%2C461.832%2C508.369%5D%2C%5B155.906%2C475.784%2C308.876%2C489.565%5D%5D%7D%7D\">“人们在社会交往中形成了各种社会关系。随着身体的 成长、智力的发展、能力的提高，我们的社会生活空间不断 延展，我们会与越来越多的人打交道，对社会生活的感受越 来越丰富，认识越来越深刻。”</span></p><p><img data-attachment-key=\"YHNLHYQ2\" width=\"685\" height=\"323\" data-annotation=\"%7B%22attachmentURI%22%3A%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F10326904%2Fitems%2FWUQZW3QQ%22%2C%22annotationKey%22%3A%22KDHB38B8%22%2C%22color%22%3A%22%23ffd400%22%2C%22pageLabel%22%3A%2210%22%2C%22position%22%3A%7B%22pageIndex%22%3A9%2C%22rects%22%3A%5B%5B75.89199999999998%2C104.50099999999985%2C486.79703598739496%2C298.44766285714286%5D%5D%7D%7D\"/><br/> 我的第一篇截图</p><p> 这是我的道法课堂笔记</p><p><img data-attachment-key=\"JGJCZLCF\" width=\"678\" height=\"271\" data-annotation=\"%7B%22attachmentURI%22%3A%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F10326904%2Fitems%2FWUQZW3QQ%22%2C%22annotationKey%22%3A%228ADG4HXR%22%2C%22color%22%3A%22%23ffd400%22%2C%22pageLabel%22%3A%2211%22%2C%22position%22%3A%7B%22pageIndex%22%3A10%2C%22rects%22%3A%5B%5B60.807%2C120.784%2C467.606%2C283.504%5D%5D%7D%7D\"/><br/></p><p><span class=\"highlight\" data-annotation=\"%7B%22attachmentURI%22%3A%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F10326904%2Fitems%2FWUQZW3QQ%22%2C%22annotationKey%22%3A%228C8NSB7Y%22%2C%22color%22%3A%22%235fb236%22%2C%22pageLabel%22%3A%2213%22%2C%22position%22%3A%7B%22pageIndex%22%3A12%2C%22rects%22%3A%5B%5B180.378%2C652.727%2C462.894%2C666.508%5D%2C%5B156.378%2C633.923%2C